   "he": "רַבִּי יוֹסֵי אוֹמֵר רׇחְבָּן שְׁלֹשָׁה טְפָחִים. אָמַר רַב יוֹסֵף אָמַר רַב יְהוּדָה אָמַר שְׁמוּאֵל: אֵין הֲלָכָה כְּרַבִּי יוֹסֵי לֹא בְּהֵילְמֵי וְלֹא בִּלְחָיַיִן.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna that «Rabbi Yosei says: The width» of the side posts must be at least «three handbreadths. Rav Yosef said» that «Rav Yehuda said» that «Shmuel said: The halakha is not in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Yosei, not with regard to» preparing salt «brine [hilmei]» on Shabbat, «and not with regard to side posts.»"
  }
